<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" style="" size="5">{!Lead.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="5"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" size="5">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="5" style=""><b style=""><br><a href="https://www.bemortgage.com/joem/" style=""><font color="#3333ff">Click here to to apply online with Joe for financing pre-approval.</font></a></b><a href="https://www.bemortgage.com/joem/" style=""><font color="#3333ff">&nbsp;</font></a>Joe's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" size="5"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="5">Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(31, 73, 125);"><img width="600" height="5" id="m_7899550035781880440m_-930273252807433251Picture_x0020_1" src="https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?ui=2&amp;ik=68ae21f3e1&amp;view=fimg&amp;th=16199f69c